stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Proposed: agent proposes refund or credit
    Proposed --> PendingApproval: FastAPI creates approval request
    PendingApproval --> Approved: human approves
    PendingApproval --> Rejected: human rejects
    Rejected --> ClosedNoMutation: no mutation allowed
    Approved --> MockMutationReady: one mock mutation unlocked
    MockMutationReady --> MockMutationExecuted: mutation.mock_refund or mutation.mock_credit_or_refund
    MockMutationExecuted --> AuditRecorded: link ticket, run, evidence, approval
    AuditRecorded --> [*]

    PendingApproval --> MutationBlocked: early mutation attempt
    MutationBlocked --> PendingApproval: keep action blocked

    note right of PendingApproval
        High-risk tools cannot execute here.
        Customer replies remain draft-only.
    end note
